Subject: Select original frontend input with an explicit native pad backend
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Make the native pad base abstract where console method bodies are unavailable;
a real desktop backend supplies every query. Native owners supply bounded pad
and FE object lifetimes instead of the console allocation-only startup helpers.
Initialize polar state, define signed angle wrapping, and share the original
51-action table. Original FE repeat, edge and focus logic remains unchanged.
Gameplay motion/DPD, rumble and complete FE scene startup remain separate work.

